arm64: dts: qcom: apq8053-lenovo-cd-18781y: add the front camera

Written for TECHO5 from the stock Lenovo device tree (camera@0: CCI
master 0 at 0x37, MCLK0 at 24 MHz, reset GPIO 40, standby GPIO 39,
rails pm8953_l6/l2/l17 with GPIOs 118 and 119 switching the digital and
analog ones, CSIPHY0 supplied by pm8953_s3) and the S5KC505A driver's
needs (two data lanes at 480 MHz).

License: GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-3-Clause (the file it changes is
BSD-3-Clause).

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/apq8053-lenovo-cd-18781y.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/apq8053-lenovo-cd-18781y.dts
